    RefIds:
    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: e9b60be26b8542d0919a12d5354aec80
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'VOID support agent (voodoo enchanter): a mid-range caster that wins fights through its allies. It keeps about 8 m behind the ally nearest the threat (some 13 m from its target, behind its tank and ahead of its long-range attackers), and spends the fight enchanting and cursing: Void Empowerment over every ally within 12 m (+25% damage, shields recharge 50% faster for 6 s), Void Ward on whoever is being hit or worn down (Support: +30 shield and +12 health), Curse on the target (Signature: true damage and three stacks of Curse) and a Curse Totem planted on it (Grenade: a destructible totem whose zone curses everyone in it every second). Its basic attack is a low true-damage bolt with a chance to add a Curse stack, only to fill the time between casts. When something gets within 7 m it phases out (Escape: Wrong Echo, walking through walls untouched for 5 s). Calm, it follows its leader and mends anyone still worn down. Kit: Support (Void Ward), Signature (Curse), Escape (Wrong Echo), Boost (Void Empowerment), Grenade (Curse Totem).'
        _children:
        - c2d1f5dbd566459bbda90d756e1aefb9
